c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8CWEwS3VjlYkHsJuULwo9cYBAeFUTRGZl9XZ_Z2aYp3A&oe=6A36BB0D"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 1.png", "id": "1021011425999827", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031547_1021011429333160_4176289926510597494_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YGeT_9xnt1EQ7kNvwF2XfAt&_nc_oc=AdpFMRn-2K8X6PwRXLnaWrvpuO21Ng9unMFsLFGl5PlguZG2Sc8eO6BRkzVXbDwh8GU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-ngXE6mn76CNmjvPSkKI-szja5rWmSQ2i9E0P4l7G_XQ&oe=6A36B0A1"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 4.png", "id": "524012790104112", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001669_524012793437445_4891316513078544414_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PYjKvItApj4Q7kNvwGO_njA&_nc_oc=AdrNZuhSFFBaP9Sobsh6czD7XtuavzG14Cr3XRja2JQT2ywgPQ3FTTziF_BIb1hephA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-eSQOG686wqb8vfiEJ9D-l20ZeBaWudIQS8CD4FCA3Iw&oe=6A36C51A"}, {"file_name": "Artboard 3.png", "id": "1187574142495669", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031470_1187574145829002_8495108821353233334_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DHE1eTQCyuMQ7kNvwH0WMQK&_nc_oc=AdpDSaSsh3yL4GNkoGkWZyHONf1dR_il6G9FJBTJVaaeL7yxUVsyac1hHwGjQaCJjug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9wI_nxEoRLGbvhkqHmKAF4HXWEto1yPXZoEP7GA7d0jA&oe=6A36B7B0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "38974450_2251639131854765_8396477208328520911_n.png", "id": "529809686395654", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476759_529809689728987_2021663405477506286_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8nma0xIGZqwQ7kNvwGvR43H&_nc_oc=Adoxp1eZ9XeIeK3OSjPfSnJZvC9qqf-MgDVHfkQ-4AsJqdO1BeQzwxRR0x_NU8TZ3ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9qyYuQZXu640K-5vTehZAWXcXWMf-2ZKVYbJl4Y5az7g&oe=6A36A9BF"}, "display_name": "Cellular Safari", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Safari Cellular** is an innovative virtual reality app that turns learning about **cellular biology** into an exciting adventure. Designed for **students, educators and science enthusiasts**, this app allows you to explore an **animal cell in 3D** like never before. Through an immersive interface, you can navigate through different cell structures, such as **the nucleus, mitochondria, and endoplasmic reticulum**, discovering their functions and importance.\n\nEach component of the cell is represented in stunning detail, allowing you to observe and understand complex biological processes in a visually engaging way. **Integrated artificial intelligence** is at your disposal to answer any questions you may have while exploring, providing clear and detailed explanations.\n\nCellular Safari is not just a passive educational experience; it includes a series of **mini interactive games** designed to consolidate your knowledge in a fun and engaging way. Through **challenges and quizzes**, you can test your understanding of biological concepts, making learning an active and stimulating process.\n\nPerfect for use in education or as a self-study tool, Cellular Safari offers a new and innovative way to explore the microscopic world of the animal cell. With **high-quality graphics** and an **intuitive user experience**, this app turns the study of biology into an unforgettable adventure.", "short_description": "Discover the fascinating world of the animal cell with Cell Safari, the educational VR app that allows you to explore cell structures in 3D. Through interactive mini-games and advanced artificial intelligence, learn scientific concepts while having fun. Ideal for students and biology enthusiasts, this immersive experience makes learning an exciting adventure."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Landscape Mini.png", "id": "2930927027073306", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.